# Level 5, Kibble Refinery: all three secrets on maps/level5.vmap (layout in
# maps/src/level5.txt), taken as detours from the fighting completion route
# of demos/level5-complete.demo (#177; the enemies made a pure walk fatal).
#   H (20,14) hazard wall behind the Sludge Pits barrel cluster -> Catnip Frenzy
#   F (34,6)  dt_screen_f1 among dt_screen_f0 in the Control Tower -> Sun Orb
#   C (20,30) conveyor running into the Packaging Line wall -> Scarab Plate
# Ends with secrets=3 and the exit; ctest secrets_level5.
vsdemo 1
level 5
skill 2
seed 0
weapon 2
# Sludge Pits: the first shot is at the barrel line next to Mutt group A.
goto 9 4
goto 12 4
